OL,3,GNEWSATwo men attacked with knife,
OL,4,Abillhook and machete
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn investigation has been launched
OL,7,Fafter two men were stabbed in County
OL,8,FTyrone on Thursday morning.
OL,10,FIt happened in Omagh town at about 1:30
OL,11,FBST at the former health centre on the
OL,12,FOld Mountfield Road and involved three
OL,13,Fmale assailants.
OL,15,FThe victims, aged 27 and 31, were in a
OL,16,Fvan which was forced into a carpark by
OL,17,Fa blue or grey five-door car, which
OL,18,Fthree men then emerged from and
OL,19,Fattacked them with weapons including a
OL,20,Fknife, billhook and a machete.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
